  "title": "Libat, Kenya",
  "text": "Libat is a settlement in Kenya 's Garissa County.\n\nAround 2016, a plan was conceived to build a wall to prevent cross-border attacks from Somalia. One of the proposed sections was a 445 kilometre wall extending from Elwak to Libat. Another was a 105 kilometre wall from Libat to Kiunga.",
